From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: n0madic <800462+n0madic@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 07:28:19 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Movies: GIF packet counts and the MPEG IPU input path

Former patches of the series, merged:
- 0055: GS: count GIF packet payloads once, at termination
- 0056: MPEG: feed the IPU bitstream a game sends over the toIPU DMA
- 0059: MPEG: let native IPU users schedule presentation
- 0061: MPEG: route native IPU input to the active decoder
- 0063: MPEG: route native IPU transfers by their source ring
---
